    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery (AKU-SoNaM) hosted the inaugural meeting of the Nursing Leaders' Forum (NLF) at its Karachi campus. The objective behind the launch of NLF is to empower nurse leaders in Pakistan to work for the sustained development of the profession through an alliance between the public and private sectors.",
